<title>USA: Regions Financial completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Regions Financial completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regions Financial Corp said it has completed the merger of Gulf South Bancshares Inc of Gretna, La., into Regions effective following the close of business on April 11.</p>
<p>The transaction was accounted for as a purchase and qualified as a tax-free reorganization for federal income purposes.</p>
<p>Stockholders of Gulf South as of April 11, will receive instructions for exchanging their Gulf South stock certificates for Regions stock certificates, along with related exchange documents.</p>
</text>
